      "OLIVE: Rhi, I can't. I told you I have plans.\nRHIANNON: You're lying. You're a lying bitch and I hate you so much right now.\nOLIVE: I'm not lying. I promise I'm not. I really would love to go camping with your family this weekend. I had fun with your family last year.",
